WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.346 --> 00:00:17.387
fought back tears.

2
00:00:17.407 --> 00:00:20.188
“How did this happen?”

3
00:00:20.928 --> 00:00:21.489
he cried.

4
00:00:22.609 --> 00:00:24.350
The prisoners began climbing.

5
00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:28.732
The Aztec priests were standing at the top of the pyramid.

6
00:00:29.608 --> 00:00:32.190
Vinnie’s heart beat faster with each step.

7
00:00:34.891 --> 00:00:36.672
Mandy ran toward the temple.

8
00:00:36.692 --> 00:00:39.974
“Vinnie!” she screamed.

9
00:00:40.794 --> 00:00:42.395
She could not find her brother.

10
00:00:43.356 --> 00:00:46.618
Suddenly she saw the prisoners on the temple steps.

11
00:00:47.598 --> 00:00:51.821
The last person in line looked very small and very familiar.

12
00:00:51.841 --> 00:00:54.282
“Mandy! Stop!

13
00:00:54.562 --> 00:00:55.603
It’s too dangerous!”

14
00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:57.584
Mazatl called to her.

15
00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:00.981
But Mandy kept pushing through the crowd.

16
00:01:01.001 --> 00:01:03.403
“Go back, little one!”

17
00:01:03.903 --> 00:01:04.683
a guard yelled.

18
00:01:05.544 --> 00:01:07.205
But Mandy was too quick.

19
00:01:08.386 --> 00:01:10.006
She ran up the stone steps.

20
00:01:10.026 --> 00:01:15.409
“Vinnie!” She grabbed her brother’s arm.

21
00:01:15.429 --> 00:01:18.571
“Mandy! What are we going to do?”

22
00:01:19.452 --> 00:01:21.113
Vinnie said in a shaky voice.

23
00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:24.014
“The photo, where is it?

24
00:01:24.354 --> 00:01:27.036
Maybe it can help us,” she said.

25
00:01:28.172 --> 00:01:29.493
“The old man!”

26
00:01:30.193 --> 00:01:31.054
gasped Vinnie.

27
00:01:31.074 --> 00:01:34.595
“I remember, he was on some steps.”

28
00:01:35.716 --> 00:01:37.157
Vinnie took the picture out.

29
00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:39.198
It was glowing blue.

30
00:01:39.218 --> 00:01:42.600
“We must be very close,” he said.

31
00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:46.382
“What are those?”

32
00:01:47.122 --> 00:01:49.944
Mandy pointed to the glowing objects in the photo.

33
00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:51.805
She looked around.

34
00:01:51.825 --> 00:01:53.786
“Vinnie! Look!”

35
00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:56.447
She pointed to the bottom of the steps.

36
00:01:57.127 --> 00:02:02.665
Statues! Mandy looked at the photo again.

37
00:02:02.685 --> 00:02:05.705
“I can’t tell what they are!”

38
00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:07.086
she shouted.

39
00:02:07.966 --> 00:02:09.506
Vinnie peered at the photo.

40
00:02:10.687 --> 00:02:12.947
Then he looked down at the stone objects.

41
00:02:14.248 --> 00:02:16.508
“There’s only one way to find out!”

42
00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:17.729
he said.

43
00:02:19.569 --> 00:02:23.230
He grabbed his sister’s hand and headed back down the steps.

44
00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:26.751
The guards began running toward the children.

45
00:02:28.371 --> 00:02:30.012
The crowd below went wild.

46
00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.321
The drums beat louder.

47
00:02:33.341 --> 00:02:37.064
“Hang on!”

48
00:02:37.844 --> 00:02:40.366
Vinnie climbed onto a huge stone ramp.

49
00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:43.168
He slid all the way down.

50
00:02:44.569 --> 00:02:45.530
Mandy followed.

51
00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:50.393
They got to the bottom and saw that the statues were dragons.

52
00:02:51.474 --> 00:02:52.915
The photo glowed red.

53
00:02:52.935 --> 00:02:56.137
“Vinnie! Mandy!”

54
00:02:56.737 --> 00:02:57.578
Mazatl called.

55
00:02:58.559 --> 00:03:00.080
They looked at their new friend.

56
00:03:00.952 --> 00:03:02.813
“Thanks for everything, Mazatl!”

57
00:03:03.354 --> 00:03:04.314
Mandy called out.

58
00:03:04.334 --> 00:03:06.756
“Don’t worry about us.”

59
00:03:08.017 --> 00:03:10.679
“We’re going home,” Vinnie shouted.

60
00:03:11.739 --> 00:03:14.761
Vinnie and Mandy held hands and closed their eyes.

61
00:03:16.202 --> 00:03:20.305
The noise of the crowd faded as the children fell down the dark tunnel.

62
00:03:21.626 --> 00:03:27.570
“Ohhh!” Vinnie and Mandy landed safely back in the attic.

63
00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:31.864
“That was a close call,” Mandy said.

64
00:03:32.965 --> 00:03:33.665
Vinnie nodded.

65
00:03:33.685 --> 00:03:37.367
“Mandy!” Mom called from below.

66
00:03:37.387 --> 00:03:38.787
“Where are you?”

67
00:03:38.807 --> 00:03:40.888
“I’m coming!”

68
00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:42.149
she yelled.

69
00:03:43.269 --> 00:03:45.510
She winked at Vinnie and ran downstairs.

70
00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.811
“What were you doing?

71
00:03:47.871 --> 00:03:48.571
We’re late!”

72
00:03:49.052 --> 00:03:49.692
Mom asked.

73
00:03:50.472 --> 00:03:51.613
She looked at Mandy.

74
00:03:51.633 --> 00:03:54.814
“What happened to that bracelet I bought you?”

75
00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:59.236
“Um, I left it in the attic.

76
00:04:00.256 --> 00:04:01.877
Come on, Mom, let’s go!”

77
00:04:04.539 --> 00:04:06.020
Vinnie looked out the window.

78
00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:09.662
His dad was looking up while mowing the lawn.

79
00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:12.444
“Vinnie, come and help me!”

80
00:04:13.064 --> 00:04:13.684
he shouted.

81
00:04:14.865 --> 00:04:16.386
Vinnie smiled and waved.

82
00:04:16.406 --> 00:04:18.427
“Okay, Dad!

83
00:04:18.747 --> 00:04:19.788
I’ll be right there.”

84
00:04:21.129 --> 00:04:25.952
After his close call with the Aztecs, mowing the lawn didn’t seem that bad.
